Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.07,0:00:14.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That was close!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.04,0:00:25.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Forgive the intrusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.46,0:00:28.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Inside me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.41,0:00:30.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My, it's cozier than I expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.51,0:00:33.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Gross! I don't have any senses, but this still feels gross!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.66,0:00:34.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.26,0:00:36.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We can't have that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.49,0:00:41.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even by doing this,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.35,0:00:45.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,you can't completely \Ncontrol my movements!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.23,0:00:48.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, I don't intend to match strengths with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.82,0:00:52.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As long as I can dampen \Nyour motions a little bit...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.04,0:00:53.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...we can finish this up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.83,0:01:02.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.00,0:01:04.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I bumped my forehead.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.11,0:01:08.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Alphonse Elric, \Nyou're coming with us...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.60,0:01:10.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,to see our boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.18,0:01:25.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Having you come after us would be problematic.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.34,0:01:31.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe I'll just crush \None of your legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.78,0:01:43.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.61,0:01:49.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,W-Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.02,0:01:56.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Man cannot obtain anything \Nwithout first sacrificing something.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.78,0:02:01.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In order to obtain anything, \Nsomething of equal value is required.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.03,0:02:06.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That is alchemy's \NLaw of Equivalent Exchange.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.77,0:02:12.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,At the time, we believed that \Nto be the true way of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.05,0:04:25.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, where are the boys?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.26,0:04:29.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Alphonse-kun was \Ntaken away by someone,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.98,0:04:33.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and Edward-kun gave chase.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.37,0:04:35.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,While you were here, \Nand you just let them go?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.74,0:04:39.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This had been \Ndropped in the garden.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.35,0:04:44.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Devil's Nest?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.82,0:04:47.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Apparently it is a bar \Noutside of town.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.26,0:04:50.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're worried about \NAlphonse-kun, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.58,0:04:53.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This wasn't your doing, was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.16,0:04:59.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If it were, I wouldn't have had them kidnap him here, would I?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.31,0:05:06.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Beyond the forest...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.64,0:05:10.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,out in the rest of the world, the fighting continues.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.89,0:05:15.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The coals of the quarrel are stoked by malice;
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.23,0:05:18.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,sparks keep flying out, \Nand it spreads ever farther.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.45,0:05:23.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why don't people \Ntry to end the strife?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.68,0:05:27.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not everyone secludes themselves in the middle of a forest,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.61,0:05:31.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,thinking of nothing \Nbut alchemy, like you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.62,0:05:36.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As long as they continue to \Nseek the Philosopher's Stone,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.57,0:05:40.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,sooner or later, disaster is going to befall those two.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.27,0:05:44.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why won't you stop them?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.79,0:05:49.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Those two will come upon their answer on their own.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.96,0:05:53.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Whatever answer that answer turns out to be,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.42,0:05:56.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,at least it will be an answer different from your ideals.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.30,0:06:01.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You still can't bring \Nyourself to believe?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.07,0:06:04.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You and I are different, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.22,0:06:07.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Both in our way of life \Nand in our alchemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.96,0:06:13.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're going, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.19,0:06:14.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.41,0:06:16.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Farewell, Izumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.59,0:06:27.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I doubt we will ever \Nsee each other again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.58,0:06:46.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.75,0:06:51.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I have to be on the lookout. \NI know it must be icky having me inside,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.63,0:06:53.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but try to put up with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.05,0:06:57.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's okay, I've gotten used to it. \NJust don't touch my bloodseal, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.19,0:07:00.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I won't be able to stay in this world if you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.29,0:07:07.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Say, Mister, how come \Nyou became Chimeras?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.92,0:07:13.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We all used to be soldiers \Na long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.01,0:07:15.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We were severely injured \Non the battlefield out east.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.97,0:07:19.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,While we were half-dead, we were taken to the military's lab facilities,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.77,0:07:21.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,where we were turned into experimental subjects.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.75,0:07:24.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The 5th Laboratory...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.44,0:07:25.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.80,0:07:32.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And it was Greed-san who \Nbroke us out of that laboratory.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.11,0:07:33.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Greed...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.82,0:07:37.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That man gave us a place where we could live.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.81,0:07:39.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.08,0:07:44.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,See, this is a hangout where folks who, \Nfor whatever little reason,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.46,0:07:48.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,can no longer go on \Nliving out in the open.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.39,0:07:50.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tucker-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.66,0:07:53.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tucker-san, are you...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.72,0:07:57.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,D-Don't misunderstand. \NI'm not here because I want to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.97,0:08:02.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The doctor here is the only one \Nwho can cure us Chimeras, you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.18,0:08:11.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Whoa, this is awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.41,0:08:15.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dr. Tucker, it's just like you said. \NHe really is hollow.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.05,0:08:19.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I-I'm not the one who had you kidnapped, you understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.74,0:08:22.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.81,0:08:26.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The name's Greed. \NLet's be friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.65,0:08:29.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,An Uroboros tattoo...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.90,0:08:32.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You know about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.88,0:08:34.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That speeds things up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.99,0:08:39.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then you're friends with those \Nother people, like Envy and Lust?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.70,0:08:44.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nope. They're more like \Nmy enemies than my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.16,0:08:45.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then why are you doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.00,0:08:48.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al... was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.19,0:08:54.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How does it feel to be just \Na spirit body—someone who can't die?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.60,0:09:04.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Transmuting an individual soul \Nand bonding it to some other object—
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.00,0:09:11.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,in other words, never getting hungry, growing tired, or growing any older.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.12,0:09:15.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's what folks call \Neternal life, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.74,0:09:17.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Eternal life...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.05,0:09:20.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You kidnapped me because that's what you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.20,0:09:23.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I have powerful appetites, you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.45,0:09:26.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I want money! I want women!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.29,0:09:27.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Status, too! Fame, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.28,0:09:33.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I want all that this world has! \NAnd that goes for eternal life, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.20,0:09:38.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You understand me? \NYou have the potential for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.24,0:09:40.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're going to \Ncooperate with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.29,0:09:45.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you refuse, I'm still going to get the secret of your soul,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.08,0:09:46.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,even if I have to dismantle you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.33,0:09:52.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What nonsense. You really are a bad person after all, Mister.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.94,0:09:55.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's up to you whether or not you act tough,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.95,0:10:00.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but there's no one who's going to rescue you from this situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.44,0:10:02.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My brother was together with me back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.71,0:10:03.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sure he's on his way here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.92,0:10:07.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's not possible. \NI beat him senseless.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.97,0:10:10.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You really {\i1}are{\i0} a bad person!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.77,0:10:22.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You let your guard down! \NI'll take care of these chains with alchemy—
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.13,0:10:24.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You'll do what?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.24,0:10:33.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, relax, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.95,0:10:35.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry, Martel.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.02,0:10:38.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I forgot you were in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.98,0:10:43.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I like a guy who can \Nset his mind to something.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.42,0:10:46.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But that's not going to \Ndo you any good at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.44,0:10:48.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you want to defeat me,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.70,0:10:50.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,you'll have to do \Nsomething like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.50,0:11:06.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How could you do that?! \NYou guys are friends, aren't you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.26,0:11:33.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That makes me dead once.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.88,0:11:37.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, can't you be a little neater when you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.20,0:11:38.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Terribly sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.76,0:11:45.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even with this body, \NI'm not exactly immortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.27,0:11:54.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.27,0:11:57.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.96,0:12:04.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Pardon me for intruding.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.28,0:12:06.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,S-Sensei!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.22,0:12:08.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sweetheart, who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.38,0:12:13.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A housewife!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.40,0:12:26.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hold up, Edward Elric!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.79,0:12:29.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're looking for \Nyour brother, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.49,0:12:32.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Have you been following me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.50,0:12:36.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You just watched quietly while Al was kidnapped?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.88,0:12:40.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We are pursuing them as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.95,0:12:43.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We couldn't allow your brother's safety to take top priority.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.92,0:12:45.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't give me that!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.98,0:12:52.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We are about to raid the Chimeras' stronghold.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.04,0:12:53.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He should be there too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.62,0:12:55.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tell me where this place is!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.01,0:12:59.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A bar called "Devil's Nest."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.81,0:13:05.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, hey, hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.33,0:13:09.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can't just start whaling on us \Nwithout any warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.44,0:13:12.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you the one in charge?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.60,0:13:14.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're looking after \None of mine, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.10,0:13:16.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're going to \Nlet me take him home.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.88,0:13:18.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.79,0:13:19.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.46,0:13:27.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Really... everything \Nyou do is so sudden.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.22,0:13:31.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You didn't break \Nyour fingers, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.75,0:13:34.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sensei!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.27,0:13:40.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's a pretty unusual body \Nyou've got there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.59,0:13:44.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I suppose. It won't be all that easy for you to inflict even a single injury on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.95,0:13:46.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.78,0:13:49.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In that case, I'm going to start taking this seriously, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.22,0:13:51.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sensei! Is Brother around?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.71,0:13:53.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's what I'd like to know!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.43,0:13:56.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I mean, you two can't even \Nrun a decent errand for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.01,0:14:00.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brace yourself, because afterward, \Nyou're going to get a proper scolding!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.12,0:14:03.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I-I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.57,0:14:10.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No transmutation circle?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.00,0:14:16.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're not going to dodge me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.29,0:14:18.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm not given to raising \Nmy hand against women.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.79,0:14:19.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.15,0:14:22.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,want to learn the secret of his transmutation.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.23,0:14:24.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And when you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.76,0:14:28.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Gain eternal life, \Nand then everything else.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.55,0:14:31.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This isn't going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.43,0:14:36.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You got him!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.22,0:14:43.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Like I said,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.36,0:14:46.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,it won't be all that easy for you to inflict even a single injury on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.13,0:15:03.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dear...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.54,0:15:06.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've had enough \Nof just looking on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.19,0:15:10.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm not...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.53,0:15:13.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,about to...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.11,0:15:18.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,lose one of my children...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.81,0:15:23.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.48,0:15:24.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.57,0:15:28.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My, my, are you still planning to go at it some more?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.05,0:15:47.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.90,0:15:51.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Izumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.66,0:15:52.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sensei!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.18,0:15:58.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You've overdone it there, sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.12,0:16:02.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay, you're going to cease your futile resistance.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.65,0:16:07.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't wanna have to do this,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.19,0:16:09.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but if you resist, \Nyou know what happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.67,0:16:12.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You get your filthy hands off of her!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.53,0:16:20.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,On the double! Fifth and Seventh Squads, \Ncover the rear entrance!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.29,0:16:23.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Third and Ninth Squads, \Nseal off the area around the bar.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.01,0:16:24.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The rest of you, take the front!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.96,0:16:31.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now we've got the older brother, huh? We've got our whole cast together.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.91,0:16:35.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tucker?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.24,0:16:36.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Edward-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.75,0:16:38.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You too?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.64,0:16:39.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You'll pay for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.14,0:16:42.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not only have you kidnapped Al, \Nbut you've gone and hurt Sensei, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.95,0:16:47.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey now, if you would just tell me how to bond a spirit, I'll just—
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.48,0:16:50.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shut up! You're going to return both Al and Sensei to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.98,0:16:52.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Be careful, Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.40,0:16:54.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That man is a homunculus!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.54,0:16:58.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Look, I've got a hostage right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.11,0:16:58.58,Dialogue Alt,,0,0,0,,Is that right? No wonder!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.66,0:17:03.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sheesh, would all of you \Njust listen to me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.25,0:17:07.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sensei!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.63,0:17:08.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ed!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.31,0:17:09.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.37,0:17:19.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Like I said,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.39,0:17:22.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm the Mightiest Shield.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.98,0:17:27.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sensei!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.01,0:17:27.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Izumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.88,0:17:38.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.58,0:17:41.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is a one-on-one fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.90,0:17:44.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Take care of Sensei.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.96,0:17:46.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.60,0:17:48.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you want to defeat me,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.46,0:17:49.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,then fight with \Nthe intent to kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.25,0:17:51.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.12,0:17:55.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm going to send you flying, no matter what!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.12,0:17:59.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ready to storm in \Nthrough the back door.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.58,0:18:01.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The alley has been sealed off.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.18,0:18:03.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ready to charge in!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.26,0:18:23.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That won't work!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.65,0:18:27.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,For crying out loud...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.70,0:18:30.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I had no idea you guys were this hard to get through to!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.60,0:18:31.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.50,0:18:35.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You even committed a taboo \Nin order to obtain what you wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.18,0:18:37.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As someone so loyal \Nto their desires,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.70,0:18:40.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I didn't think it would be so hard for you to understand me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.97,0:18:43.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't you lump me in with the likes of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.21,0:18:45.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.59,0:18:49.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Whether we're homunculus or human, it doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.20,0:18:52.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We live only to be devoted to our desires, don't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.88,0:18:53.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.83,0:18:58.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know about how you are now \Nlooking for the Philosopher's Stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.72,0:19:01.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't care about \Nthe Philosopher's Stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.26,0:19:02.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I just want to return Al—
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.92,0:19:05.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,my brother—to his original form!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.71,0:19:08.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He'd be better off \Nstaying the way he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.80,0:19:13.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do you know?! Don't you presume to decide that for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.50,0:19:16.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I have no intention of negotiating.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.40,0:19:22.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you homunculi are born of \Nthe errors made by us alchemists,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.96,0:19:27.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,then we alchemists will just \Nhave to correct those errors.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.17,0:19:31.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is that a fact?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.95,0:19:35.65,Dialogue,,60,60,0,,This kind of turns me into an ugly man, \Nso I was hoping not to have to show it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.92,0:19:38.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But out of consideration \Nfor your resolve,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.31,0:19:41.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm going to take you on seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.52,0:19:44.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.00,0:19:47.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is my serious mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.91,0:19:48.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bring it on!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.82,0:20:05.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Barely felt that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.39,0:20:07.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you serious?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.12,0:20:10.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The composition and structural material of my body is as normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.56,0:20:13.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Mightiest Shield, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.48,0:20:17.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You've never killed \Nsomeone before, have you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.18,0:20:18.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.99,0:20:21.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm saying you don't have the heart to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.18,0:20:25.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You won't be able to \Ndefeat me like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.00,0:20:28.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And that goes for \Nthe other homunculi too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.13,0:20:31.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let me give you enough heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.59,0:20:37.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who the hell are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.29,0:20:44.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.68,0:20:45.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Greed-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.80,0:20:48.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bad news! The military—
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.02,0:20:52.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Greed-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.52,0:20:56.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now of all times... \NThe big show is going to be ruined.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.08,0:20:59.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is this really the time \Nto be acting so casual?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.51,0:21:04.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't panic.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.26,0:21:07.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's no one in the military who can do anything to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.00,0:21:14.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kimbly...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.27,0:21:23.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why, you! You betrayed me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.69,0:21:29.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Greed-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.64,0:21:31.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come on, we're going!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.35,0:21:32.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.15,0:21:35.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Catch you later, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.18,0:21:37.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're not getting away from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.85,0:21:40.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.93,0:21:42.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please do not resist.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.57,0:21:44.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Resist? What are you talking—
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.20,0:21:47.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lt. Col. Archer is calling for you. \NPlease come with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.44,0:21:50.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're about to take my brother away! \NI can't just sit back and—
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.93,0:21:54.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That is an order.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.94,0:23:40.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Fullmetal Alchemist{\i0}...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.65,0:23:44.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Episode 34: "Theory of Greed"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.52,0:23:46.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You'll pay for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.48,0:23:49.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Greed, I {\i1}will{\i0} defeat you!
